        <mxCell id="f0" value="1  Two ACTIVE regions (eastus2, centralus) serving separate user cohorts simultaneously - true active-active, Labs 11-18" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#243A5E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#243A5E;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="600" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f1" value="2  One WARM-STANDBY region (westus2) protecting eastus2 specifically - a genuinely different pattern, Lab 19" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#243A5E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#243A5E;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="640" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f2" value="3  CORRECTED: westus2 peers to BOTH eastus2 and centralus - DR identity no longer depends solely on the region it protects" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B77300;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B77300;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="680" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f3" value="4  Non-overlapping Entra groups (Lab 16) keep every user assigned to exactly one active region at a time" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#243A5E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#243A5E;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="720" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f4" value="5  FSLogix Cloud Cache (Lab 15) replicates profiles between the two ACTIVE regions only - westus2 is not part of that replication" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#243A5E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#243A5E;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="760" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f5" value="6  Independent monitoring and autoscaling per active region (Labs 17-18) - no shared workspace, no shared scaling plan" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#243A5E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#243A5E;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="800" width="1380" height="32" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="f6" value="7  Teardown order in Lab 20's own text: 19 and 20 first, then 14-18, then 12-13, then 11 last - matching the dependency graph, not the numbering" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#243A5E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#243A5E;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
