        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="foot" value="Original architecture diagram for this book, not Microsoft's. Corrected: DR identity no longer depends on the failed region. Verified against terraform/lab11 through lab19, August 2026. Self-contained, no remote icon dependency." style="text;fontSize=10;fontColor=#605E5C;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
